era:Fee
	a owl:Class ;
	rdfs:label "Fee"@en ;
	rdfs:comment """Fees are used to represent additional costs for services or products. In contrast to other offer parts in OSDM, the customer is not free whether to choose a fee or not: fees are generated and applied to other services or products by the providing system.
"""@en ;
