era:PartialPriceType
	a owl:Class ;
	rdfs:label "Type of partial price"@en ;
	rdfs:comment """As a reservation might contain more than one tariff, the partial price can be used to define the price per tariff code. This partial price is needed to calculate the totalm price in different currencies, as the currency conversion has to be aplied on the price per tariff and passenger to avoid rounding errors.
"""@en ;
