era:RID
	a owl:Class ;
	rdfs:subClassOf era:SpecialProvisionsRID ;
	rdfs:label "R ID"@en ;
	rdfs:comment 'The requirement (optional/mandatory) of the RID detail tags depend on the dangerous good and the regarding RID regulations.In contrast to the element "DangerousGoodsIndication" which only provides information to be provided to the IM according to chapter 1.4 RID, "RID" contains all information demanded in chapter 5.4 RID in order tpo provide all information used for RUs'@en ;
