era:TimingAtLocation
	a owl:Class ;
	rdfs:subClassOf era:Timing ;
	rdfs:label "Timing at location"@en ;
	rdfs:comment """Timing at an operation point
It has an attribute TimerQualifierCode with the following values:
PLA = Public Location Arrival
ELA = Earliest Location Arrival
ALA = Actual Location Arival
LLA = Latest Location Arrival
PLD = Public Location Departure
ELD = Earliest Location Departure
ALD = Actual Location Departure
LLD = Latest Location Departure
ERT = Earliest Run Through
ART = Actual Run Through
LRT = Latest Run Through    			
			"""@en ;
	era:shaclShapeValidationRule <http://data.europa.eu/949/shapes/NodeShape/TimingAtLocation> ;
	era:usedInTelematics "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
	dcterms:created "2026-10-02T13:08:22+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
	dcterms:references "https://gitlab.com/era-europa-eu/public/era-telematics-tsi/tsi_telematics/-/blob/V4.0.0/TD_105_xsd/taf_cat_complete.xsd"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	.

