	a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
	rdfs:subPropertyOf era:vehicleTypeTechnicalDataCharacteristic ;
	rdfs:label "Type number"@en ;
	rdfs:comment """Each type of vehicle shall receive a number consisting of 10 digits with the structure as in Annex III of the ERATV Decision.

For the full Vehicle Identifier, use `dcterms:identifier`.
